Fuyao Locale changes include the new product identity and package namespace,
Kotlin and Jetpack Compose architecture, Material 3 interface, application
and locale list pipelines, batch locale workflows, saved configurations,
adaptive layouts, localization, and build and signing setup.

Holo ICS theme assets
---------------------
The "Holo ICS" interface style embeds Android framework resources and fonts
taken verbatim from Android Open Source Project tag android-4.0.4_r2.1
(frameworks/base commit df331873c8576e0ae34ae1ee3cc258beed373535),
Copyright (C) The Android Open Source Project, licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0 (LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt). The complete per-file source
mapping, densities, and SHA-256 checksums are recorded in
docs/holo-ics/asset-manifest.json. Files were renamed with the holo_ics_
prefix; no pixel content was modified.

