Material 3 switch geometry and color-role adaptation
--------------------------------------------------
Based on AndroidX Compose Material 3 1.5.0-alpha27 Switch.kt,
Copyright The Android Open Source Project, Apache License 2.0.
Fuyao Locale retains the source dimensions, state colors and motion scheme,
and adds continuous pointer dragging with a single release-time callback.
Source artifact: androidx.compose.material3:material3-android:1.5.0-alpha27.
